id: DRAFT-paperjam-1.2.2-disable-ld-preload-embed-dt-rpath-tmp-vendored
trigger_tool: make|conan|test
phase: building|testing
error_signature: Error loading shared library libjpeg\.so\.62.*needed by.*libqpdf\.so|no such file or directory: '.*/e/vendored/paper\.c'|HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status": *"no_tests"
severity: 3
category: ohos, build-system, testing, portability, musl
match_keywords: dt_rpath, ld_preload, temporary_directory_readonly, export_sources_folder, no_tests
title: OHOS上停用LD_PRELOAD改用内嵌DT_RPATH解析传递依赖并修复只读tmp与vendored定位，6/6验证通过真机证据门禁
root_cause: OHOS musl loader忽略LD_LIBRARY_PATH且不从LD_PRELOAD其余条目解析被预载库自身的DT_NEEDED传递依赖，预载libqpdf必死于其DT_NEEDED libjpeg.so.62；兼有裸mktemp -d写只读/tmp、Conan2 exports_sources误当recipe_folder读取致e/vendored缺失、MANIFEST非空测试命令致no_tests误判为上游存在测试
affected_scope: OHOS上动态链接Conan共享库且经libqpdf等传递依赖叶库的CLI包，需自带vendored shim、test脚本写tmp、上游无测试套件的plain-Makefile配方
verification_cmd: 真机preflight应显示RESULT: 6 passed, 0 failed与HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT executed true passed true discovered 6 passedCount 6，且readelf -d显示DT_RPATH含conan依赖libdir
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: disable-ld-preload-embed-dt-rpath
rec_description: 主二进制经LDFLAGS/LDLIBS双通道嵌入-Wl,--disable-new-dtags加-Wl,-rpath指向各依赖libdir自带DT_RPATH解析qpdf及传递libjpeg；测试包彻底停用LD_PRELOAD并unset；test.sh改用TMPDIR模板mktemp并修正计数5到6；vendored改export_sources_folder定位；MANIFEST测试命令置空并结构化审计no_tests
rec_command: conanfile.py: rpath_flags经LDFLAGS/LDLIBS传入make LDLIBS；test_package/conanfile.py: 删除LD_PRELOAD改为llvm-readelf/readelf -d诊断；test.sh: 顶部unset LD_PRELOAD加mktemp -d ${TMPDIR}/paperjam.XXXXXX加6项真实调用；MANIFEST.yml: upstream_check_command/upstream_test_command置空加upstream_test_audit结构化映射
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: bundle-leaf-libs-or-static-link
fallback_description: 若plain-Makefile吃不进RPATH或平台不允许RPATH，将叶依赖so随包安装并由包装脚本显式路径加载，或对传递叶库改静态链接，保留readelf与RESULT证据
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: Error loading shared library .*needed by.*\.so
forbid_1_reason: 禁止用LD_PRELOAD解析被预载库自身的DT_NEEDED传递依赖；OHOS上qpdf-first与jpeg-first两种预载顺序均复现libjpeg.so.62失败，证明顺序无关机制不可用
forbid_1_consequence: 真机test_package报Error loading shared library且test.sh无RESULT行，门禁test_package_result_absent失败并抛test.sh produced no RESULT line
similar_to: [DRAFT-gssdp-ohos-dt-rpath-disable-new-dtags, DRAFT-lzop-no-tests-structured-audit]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-paperjam-1.2.2-disable-ld-preload-embed-dt-rpath-tmp-vendored.md
last_updated: 2026-09-06
source_event: paperjam/1.2.2 真机预检 LD_PRELOAD传递依赖失败改DT_RPATH后6/6通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 8623
